{"ID":"20240118151255-buocqwk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151255-buocqwk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151255-buocqwk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151255-x4vwk85\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122103937-611h388\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122103937-611h388\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:237,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:237\u0026#125;","title":"096枸杞","type":"doc","updated":"20240130090253"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151255-x4vwk85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151255-x4vwk85","updated":"20240122103802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦寒，主五内邪气，热中消渴，周痹，久服坚筋骨，轻身不老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103804-6fopps3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103804-6fopps3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，其子名枸杞，根皮名地骨皮，均入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103809-2jcu97z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103809-2jcu97z"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘苦，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103811-9vjtkjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103811-9vjtkjs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】枸杞子为滋肾养肝要药，生精润肺要药，主五内邪热，周痹风湿，坚筋骨，补精气，治虚劳，明目。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103813-qr1vgos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103813-qr1vgos"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】下胸胁气，客热头痛，补内伤大劳嘘吸，强阴，利大小肠。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103814-m4jgold","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103814-m4jgold"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】补精气，诸不足，易颜色，变白，明目安神。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103816-y0pk7ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103816-y0pk7ir"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】坚筋骨，耐老，除风去虚劳，补精气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103817-cdy0pv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103817-cdy0pv3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【好古】主心病嗌干，心痛，渴而引饮，肾病消中。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103818-o6qjpp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103818-o6qjpp5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103820-15l8ind","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103820-15l8ind"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】凡有外邪实热，脾虚有湿及肠滑者忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122103924-a6bbo9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103924-a6bbo9g"}},{"ID":"20240122103930-p7tl2y9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103930-p7tl2y9","updated":"20240130085845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第96味药，枸杞。老师，这个很多啦，这个我们大家都知道枸杞常常拿来炖鸡啊，出至《神农本草经》里面，有没有听说人家吃枸杞死掉的，没有嘛。所以中药就这样，很好啊。枸杞的这个树的子呢叫枸杞，它的树根呢，叫地骨皮，所以它的子跟地根，它的根，两个都入药。啊，地骨皮。那常常吃枸杞好不好？当然好啊，你平常没事在诊所里面，在办公室里面，可以泡一些，拿两片黄芪，几颗枸杞在里面，当然你环境比较好一点，泡一点红参，我就有上好的高丽参，但我都省给病人吃。你可以泡一些甘草啊，黄芪，然后枸杞，把它当茶喝，当茶喝的时候，那个气会很旺，讲话就声音就很大。"}]},{"ID":"20240122103931-ofmfcc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103931-ofmfcc0","updated":"20240130090202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平常用的枸杞，中药用，因为它的颜色是红的，这个能够养肺。我们中医啊，治肺，心是红色的，赤色的，我们治疗心脏的时候，所有红色的药，一进来的时候，一定会去润肺。为什么？因为木火土金水，中医在治疗心脏病，第一个我们要去治金，所以把肺弄好，心脏就会好。就好像一个修车师傅，引擎有问题，他会去查水箱，水箱就是肺，引擎就是心脏。这个枸杞呢，生津止渴，能用糖尿病的人消渴，口渴不止都可以吃。因为它是红色的，是淡味的红，不是厚味的红，如果味道很重，我们知道是入血分，它是淡味的，淡味的红它入气分，所以气分它就会入肺脏。它是润肺的，很好的药。那我们常常在讲话的人吃吃枸杞，你不用拿起来当花生米，多硬呀，吃得牙齿断掉，泡起来吃，泡在热水里面，当茶泡。那你说，老师我打枸杞粉啊什么的，都不要！就原枸杞丢下去，黄芪啊。那过去呢，我们枸杞一直在临床上，我会放在上面的东西很多我已经帮诸位删掉，因为乱讲，没有那种效果。因为我们看病不能讲错话，这个里面我都挑了真的有用的效果，我才拿来。"}]},{"ID":"20240122103937-611h388","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122103937-611h388","updated":"20240130090253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枸杞本身"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"除了治肺气以外，治虚劳，明目，对眼睛很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那老师，你前面讲过了，决明子炒过以后泡起来对眼睛很好，那放点枸杞，很好啊，滋补嘛，如果给先生吃，怀疑他有女朋友，放一点菟丝子给他吃，强精啊，但是他倒阳。倒阳有很多种方法，我一定要教会诸位倒阳，不然的话，你不知道怎样生阳啊。就好像我们要治病，要把别人治回来，你要知道怎样杀人。它是坚筋骨，长期吃的话，美容养颜。大家气色会非常的好，这个肾脏病的时候我们都可以吃，随时可以补气的。过去我们常常炖鸡啊什么的，放点枸杞在里面。枸杞子。"}]}]}